  "final-02.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 1 complete: 64 cases audited, deterministic audit output added, and replay memory usage reduced. All 44 tests pass, including public tests.\n\n[Report](/task/audit/batch-1-report.json), [audit](/task/audit/batch-1-audit.json), and [exact operational notes](/task/audit/operations-notes.json) saved.\n\nUnresolved: timestamp/sequence discrepancies remain documented for contract review. R1 remains in force: timestamp ordering, pending state across epochs, and verification flags surviving failed VERIFY. No semantic revisions applied.",
