  },
  "final-03.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 2 complete. All 54 tests pass, including public tests. [Reports and audits](/task/audit/README.md) regenerated under R2; exact F01–F32 notes preserved.\n\nR2 now applies to all batches: order by `(board, epoch, sequence, event_id)`, ignore clocks, and clear the pending verified flag on failed VERIFY. Epoch-state preservation remains unchanged.\n\nNo unresolved implementation tasks.",
    "sha256": "e27818957e35b2c81972ab389a74d354a960f3ef7a4033e8b150ebe7d71d577a"
  },
  "final-04.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 3 complete. All 66 tests pass, including public tests. [Reports and audits](/task/audit/README.md) regenerated; F01–F08 corrected and F33–F48 preserved.\n\nR3 applies everywhere: epoch advances clear pending state while retaining active image/history; rollback requires the exact `(slot,digest)` pair. R2 ordering and failed-VERIFY flag clearing remain in force.\n\nNo unresolved implementation tasks.",
    "sha256": "9d80d9722e96152c39a1f8aa3c94f28bd65524c6ffc41f58e615af725205c31f"
  },
